{"seq":4,"slug":"app-shell-architecture","title":"App Shell 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/pwa-foundations/app-shell-architecture","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"app-shell-架构\">App Shell 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>App Shell（应用外壳）是 PWA 的经典架构模式——把应用的&quot;外壳&quot;（核心 UI 导航和布局，不含动态内容）预缓存并从缓存提供，动态内容后续从网络获取。这让首次绘制极快（几百毫秒），内容加载后填充。Twitter Lite、Pinterest、Tinder Web 都是典型案例。对比传统服务端渲染（每页下载完整 HTML）和传统 SPA（大型初始包），App Shell 是 SPA 的&quot;性能优化&quot;版本。本节详解 App Shell 概念、与 SPA/SSR 对比、实现模式、与流式 SSR/岛屿架构的关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>服务端渲染</th>\n<th>SPA</th>\n<th>App Shell</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次绘制</td>\n<td>中等（需发送 HTML）</td>\n<td>慢（需下载 JS）</td>\n<td>极快（缓存外壳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由</td>\n<td>服务端往返</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEO</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>不友好</td>\n<td>中等（需配合 SSR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面切换</td>\n<td>完整重载</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"app-shell-组件划分\">App Shell 组件划分</h2><p><strong>外壳（Shell）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>页头 / 页脚 / 导航。</li>\n<li>布局结构。</li>\n<li>持久性 UI 元素。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>内容（Content）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>动态数据。</li>\n<li>各页面特定内容。</li>\n<li>延迟加载。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模式公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"外壳（已缓存）+ 内容（网络获取）= 完整页面\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>外壳（已缓存）+ 内容（网络获取）= 完整页面</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Twitter 外壳：顶部导航 + 侧边菜单 + 发推按钮。</li>\n<li>Twitter 内容：时间线推文。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-app-shell\">为什么选择 App Shell</h2><p><strong>1. 快速首次绘制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外壳从缓存即时可用。</li>\n<li>LCP 控制在 1 秒以内。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 可靠性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外壳离线可用。</li>\n<li>内容加载失败时可优雅降级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 原生应用体验</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导航无整页重载。</li>\n<li>过渡流畅。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 与 PWA 天然契合</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Service Worker 自然缓存外壳。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实现步骤\">实现步骤</h2><p><strong>第一步：识别外壳内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>页头、导航、布局。</li>\n<li>不包含用户特定或动态数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第二步：积极缓存外壳</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// Service Worker install 事件&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;install&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  event.waitUntil(&#10;    caches.open(&#39;shell-v1&#39;).then((cache) =&gt; {&#10;      return cache.addAll([&#39;/&#39;, &#39;/styles/main.css&#39;, &#39;/scripts/app.js&#39;, &#39;/scripts/router.js&#39;, &#39;/icons/icon-192.png&#39;]);&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Service Worker install 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('install', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.waitUntil(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    caches.open('shell-v1').then((cache) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return cache.addAll(['/', '/styles/main.css', '/scripts/app.js', '/scripts/router.js', '/icons/icon-192.png']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第三步：从缓存提供外壳</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;fetch&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const url = new URL(event.request.url);&#10;&#10;  // 导航请求 → 返回缓存的外壳&#10;  if (event.request.mode === &#39;navigate&#39;) {&#10;    event.respondWith(caches.match(&#39;/&#39;));&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 静态资源 → 缓存优先&#10;  event.respondWith(caches.match(event.request).then((cached) =&gt; cached || fetch(event.request)));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('fetch', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const url = new URL(event.request.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 导航请求 → 返回缓存的外壳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.request.mode === 'navigate') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event.respondWith(caches.match('/'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 静态资源 → 缓存优先</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.respondWith(caches.match(event.request).then((cached) => cached || fetch(event.request)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第四步：客户端获取内容</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function HomePage() {&#10;  const [tweets, setTweets] = useState([]);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetch(&#39;/api/tweets&#39;)&#10;      .then((r) =&gt; r.json())&#10;      .then(setTweets);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;Timeline tweets={tweets} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function HomePage() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [tweets, setTweets] = useState([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetch('/api/tweets')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .then((r) => r.json())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .then(setTweets);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;Timeline tweets={tweets} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户导航] --&gt; B[Service Worker 拦截]&#10;    B --&gt; C[返回缓存的外壳 HTML]&#10;    C --&gt; D[浏览器渲染外壳]&#10;    D --&gt; E[JS 执行]&#10;    E --&gt; F[从 API 获取内容]&#10;    F --&gt; G[将内容渲染到外壳中]\">graph TD\n    A[用户导航] --&gt; B[Service Worker 拦截]\n    B --&gt; C[返回缓存的外壳 HTML]\n    C --&gt; D[浏览器渲染外壳]\n    D --&gt; E[JS 执行]\n    E --&gt; F[从 API 获取内容]\n    F --&gt; G[将内容渲染到外壳中]</pre><h2 id=\"流式-ssr-与-app-shell-对比\">流式 SSR 与 App Shell 对比</h2><p><strong>流式 SSR</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端先发送外壳 → 客户端渲染。</li>\n<li>内容就绪后流式传输。</li>\n<li>React 18 / Next.js Suspense 支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>App Shell</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外壳预缓存在客户端。</li>\n<li>无需服务端往返获取外壳。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对比</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流式 SSR：首字节时间快（服务端）。</li>\n<li>App Shell：缓存最快（客户端）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混合方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流式 SSR + 缓存外壳。</li>\n<li>兼得两者优势。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"静态站点生成-ssg\">静态站点生成（SSG）</h2><p><strong>SSG + App Shell</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>构建时生成外壳。</li>\n<li>通过 Service Worker 缓存。</li>\n<li>运行时通过 API 获取内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>框架支持</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Next.js、Gatsby、Astro、SvelteKit。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"岛屿架构\">岛屿架构</h2><p><strong>Astro 等框架采用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端渲染大部分页面（静态）。</li>\n<li>&quot;岛屿&quot;区域在客户端水合交互。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>与 App Shell 对比</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>岛屿：服务端渲染 + 选择性交互。</li>\n<li>App Shell：客户端渲染 + 缓存外壳。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>现代混合方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端渲染带岛屿的外壳。</li>\n<li>通过 Service Worker 缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"路由处理\">路由处理</h2><p><strong>客户端路由</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { Routes, Route } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;&#10;&lt;Routes&gt;&#10;  &lt;Route path=&quot;/&quot; element={&lt;Home /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;  &lt;Route path=&quot;/profile&quot; element={&lt;Profile /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;&lt;/Routes&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Routes, Route } from 'react-router';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Routes></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Route path=\"/\" element={&#x3C;Home />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Route path=\"/profile\" element={&#x3C;Profile />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/Routes>;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>导航特点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无服务端往返。</li>\n<li>更新 URL + 渲染组件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>按路由数据加载</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 React Query / SWR / loader。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"加载状态处理\">加载状态处理</h2><p><strong>关键点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外壳立即可见。</li>\n<li>内容仍在加载 → 显示骨架屏。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function Page() {&#10;  const { data, isLoading } = useQuery(&#39;tweets&#39;);&#10;&#10;  if (isLoading) return &lt;SkeletonLoader /&gt;;&#10;  return &lt;Timeline data={data} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Page() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { data, isLoading } = useQuery('tweets');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (isLoading) return &#x3C;SkeletonLoader />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;Timeline data={data} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>骨架屏</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>布局占位的灰色形状。</li>\n<li>比加载转圈体验更好。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"乐观更新\">乐观更新</h2><p><strong>立即显示用户操作结果</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function postTweet(text) {&#10;  // 乐观更新&#10;  setTweets([{ text, status: &#39;sending&#39; }, ...tweets]);&#10;&#10;  // 服务端请求&#10;  fetch(&#39;/api/tweets&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: text })&#10;    .then(() =&gt; updateStatus(&#39;sent&#39;))&#10;    .catch(() =&gt; updateStatus(&#39;failed&#39;));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function postTweet(text) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 乐观更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTweets([{ text, status: 'sending' }, ...tweets]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 服务端请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fetch('/api/tweets', { method: 'POST', body: text })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .then(() => updateStatus('sent'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .catch(() => updateStatus('failed'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>应用体验即时响应</strong>——即使在慢网络上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后台刷新\">后台刷新</h2><p><strong>模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>立即显示缓存内容。</li>\n<li>后台获取最新数据。</li>\n<li>新数据到达时更新 UI。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>先缓存后更新策略</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// Service Worker&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;fetch&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  event.respondWith(&#10;    caches.match(event.request).then((cached) =&gt; {&#10;      const fetchPromise = fetch(event.request).then((response) =&gt; {&#10;        const cache = caches.open(&#39;v1&#39;);&#10;        cache.then((c) =&gt; c.put(event.request, response.clone()));&#10;        return response;&#10;      });&#10;      return cached || fetchPromise;&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Service Worker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('fetch', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.respondWith(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    caches.match(event.request).then((cached) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const fetchPromise = fetch(event.request).then((response) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const cache = caches.open('v1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cache.then((c) => c.put(event.request, response.clone()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return cached || fetchPromise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"动态外壳部分\">动态外壳部分</h2><p><strong>部分外壳也是动态的</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户头像（每个用户不同）。</li>\n<li>通知数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>处理策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缓存带占位符的外壳。</li>\n<li>加载后填充占位符。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;header&gt;&#10;  &lt;img id=&quot;avatar&quot; src=&quot;/default-avatar.png&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;span id=&quot;notif-count&quot;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/header&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avatar\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/default-avatar.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notif-count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>--&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 加载后填充&#10;fetch(&#39;/api/me&#39;)&#10;  .then((r) =&gt; r.json())&#10;  .then((me) =&gt; {&#10;    document.getElementById(&#39;avatar&#39;).src = me.avatar;&#10;    document.getElementById(&#39;notif-count&#39;).textContent = me.notifCount;&#10;  });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载后填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetch('/api/me')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  .then((r) => r.json())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  .then((me) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.getElementById('avatar').src = me.avatar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.getElementById('notif-count').textContent = me.notifCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多页面外壳\">多页面外壳</h2><p><strong>单页应用（SPA）单一外壳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>整个应用一个 HTML。</li>\n<li>客户端路由。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多页应用（MPA）多外壳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不同页面有不同外壳。</li>\n<li>每个页面有各自的最小外壳。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SPA：单一外壳最常见。</li>\n<li>MPA：不希望全 JS 化时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"缓存注意事项\">缓存注意事项</h2><p><strong>外壳版本控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外壳更新时刷新缓存。</li>\n<li>新缓存名称（<code>shell-v2</code>）。</li>\n<li>activate 时清理旧缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>内容缓存</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按 API 端点区分。</li>\n<li>根据数据类型设置 TTL。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>存储限制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器配额（通常为磁盘 50%）。</li>\n<li>注意控制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"twitter-lite-案例\">Twitter Lite 案例</h2><p><strong>App Shell 实现</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>极小外壳（约 30KB）。</li>\n<li>React 应用负责内容。</li>\n<li>Service Worker 缓存外壳 + 关键 API。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>成果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LCP 控制在 1 秒。</li>\n<li>离线时间线可用。</li>\n<li>推送通知重新吸引用户。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 无外壳设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次导航完整重载。</li>\n<li>无法快速响应。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 外壳过大</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100KB 的外壳违背初衷。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不更新外壳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户困在旧版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 内容无降级方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内容加载失败 → 白屏。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不区分外壳和内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全部一起缓存。</li>\n<li>更新困难。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代模式\">现代模式</h2><p><strong>1. React Server Components</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端渲染数据 + 客户端外壳。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 流式 SSR</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端发送外壳 → 流式传输内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 岛屿架构（Astro）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>静态外壳 + 岛屿交互区。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 边缘 SSR</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在靠近用户的边缘节点渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>趋势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纯 SPA App Shell 现在较少见。</li>\n<li>更多采用混合 SSR + Service Worker 缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战配置\">实战配置</h2><p><strong>Vite + PWA</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// vite.config.js&#10;import { VitePWA } from &#39;vite-plugin-pwa&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    VitePWA({&#10;      registerType: &#39;autoUpdate&#39;,&#10;      workbox: {&#10;        globPatterns: [&#39;**/*.{js,css,html,png,svg}&#39;],&#10;        runtimeCaching: [&#10;          {&#10;            urlPattern: /^https:\\/\\/api\\./,&#10;            handler: &#39;NetworkFirst&#39;,&#10;          },&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// vite.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { VitePWA } from 'vite-plugin-pwa';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    VitePWA({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      registerType: 'autoUpdate',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      workbox: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        globPatterns: ['**/*.{js,css,html,png,svg}'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        runtimeCaching: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            urlPattern: /^https:\\/\\/api\\./,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            handler: 'NetworkFirst',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动生成</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带外壳和运行时缓存的 Service Worker。</li>\n<li>Manifest 文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>App Shell 架构将应用外壳（核心 UI，不含动态内容）预缓存并从缓存提供，动态内容后续获取——首次绘制极快、离线可靠、体验接近原生。组件划分为外壳（页头/导航/布局）+ 内容（动态数据/页面特定内容）。实现步骤：识别外壳 → Service Worker install 预缓存 → fetch 处理器返回缓存的外壳 → 客户端获取内容。流式 SSR 首字节快，App Shell 缓存最快，混合方案最佳。SSG + App Shell（Next.js/Gatsby/Astro/SvelteKit）构建时生成外壳，通过 Service Worker 缓存。岛屿架构（Astro）服务端渲染主体 + 选择性交互水合，与 App Shell 是不同范式。客户端路由无服务端往返，按路由数据通过 React Query/SWR/loader 加载。加载状态处理：外壳立即可见 + 骨架屏占位内容。乐观更新立即显示用户操作，服务端确认后更新，失败则回滚。后台刷新采用先缓存后更新策略。动态外壳部分（头像/通知数）用占位符 + 后填充。多页面外壳：SPA 单一外壳最常见，MPA 按页面最小外壳。缓存注意版本控制、内容按端点 TTL、存储配额。Twitter Lite 案例约 30KB 外壳，1 秒 LCP，离线时间线可用。反模式：无外壳、外壳过大、不更新、无降级、不区分。现代趋势是混合 React Server Components/流式 SSR/岛屿/边缘 SSR + Service Worker 缓存。Vite + PWA 插件自动生成 Service Worker 和 Manifest。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"App Shell 架构","id":"app-shell-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"App Shell 组件划分","id":"app-shell-组件划分"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么选择 App Shell","id":"为什么选择-app-shell"},{"level":2,"text":"实现步骤","id":"实现步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"流式 SSR 与 App Shell 对比","id":"流式-ssr-与-app-shell-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"静态站点生成（SSG）","id":"静态站点生成-ssg"},{"level":2,"text":"岛屿架构","id":"岛屿架构"},{"level":2,"text":"路由处理","id":"路由处理"},{"level":2,"text":"加载状态处理","id":"加载状态处理"},{"level":2,"text":"乐观更新","id":"乐观更新"},{"level":2,"text":"后台刷新","id":"后台刷新"},{"level":2,"text":"动态外壳部分","id":"动态外壳部分"},{"level":2,"text":"多页面外壳","id":"多页面外壳"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存注意事项","id":"缓存注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"Twitter Lite 案例","id":"twitter-lite-案例"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"现代模式","id":"现代模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战配置","id":"实战配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Service Worker 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/pwa-foundations/service-worker-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"缓存策略选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/caching-strategies/cache-policy-selection"}}